Forked at commit 5a7c907 (tagged `upstream-baseline` in this repository),
corresponding to Edge-Drop v0.2.2.

hovr retains Edge-Drop's edge-docked window, hover-expand interaction, and
animation/styling layer, and replaces its clipboard-manager functionality with a
system-metrics widget shelf. Files inherited from Edge-Drop have been modified;
see `git diff upstream-baseline` for the complete set of changes.

